DeepSeek Harness (DSH)
https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness
Test baseline: DSH 0.2.1-rc.2, commit
332895e0f7c9d4dbfb29729f5eb367fa263ff986.

The frozen English native catalog in test/fixtures/native-catalogs.json contains
upstream UI strings used only for parity tests. Russian dictionaries retain the
corresponding public namespace/key structure. The directory-browser supplemental
13-key English contract is documented directly in the test. No compiled DSH
runtime code is included; lifecycle tests use a local public-API mock.

